          "line": 321,
          "message": "The AC2 unchanged-state assertion does not compare the full basis and audit events, so it can pass after those persisted values change.",
          "confidence": 0.94,
          "category": "other",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The AC2 test calls AssertStateUnchanged after each replay and rejected commit. That helper compares basis digests, audit details, and audit-event count, but not basis content or the other audit fields.",
